      (MvPolynomial.C a * wcpaLquLin c α + MvPolynomial.C b * wcpaLquLin c β) ∈ wcpaLquI F c 2) ∧
    (∀ a b : K, MvPolynomial.C a * wcpaLquLin c α + MvPolynomial.C b * wcpaLquLin c β ∈
