            (wcpaDjCocPull (p ≫ φ) L).V b ⊓ q ⁻¹ᵁ ⊤ ≤
            (wcpaDjCocPull (p ≫ φ) L).V b ⊓ q ⁻¹ᵁ ⊤ from
